    "Annotations": [
      {
        "Id": "d3595945c93440f4b859d44afe381776",
        "Title": "You need to have an OpenAI API Key to run this demo\r\n",
        "DescriptionText": "An API key is like a fixed unique \"password\" that is associated with your OpenAI account. It allows you to access the OpenAI services from programming code.\r\n\r\nHow to obtain an API key:\r\n\r\n1. If you don't have an OpenAI account yet, register for one at: https://beta.openai.com/signup\r\n\r\n(Each new account will get 18 US Dollars worth of free credits, valid for 3 months. \r\nGenerating texts and/or images WILL cost credits) \r\n\r\n2. Log-in to your account \r\n\r\n4. Go to your account settings and look for the API Key session, and create a new API key.\r\n\r\n6. Copy and Paste the API key here in Grasshopper\r\n\r\n(IMPORTANT: Keep your API key private, otherwise other people may use it to access your OpenAI account and credits!)",
        "IsExpanded": true,
